sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CTC as CTC Office
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    CTC->>H: TrainSuggestion(train, line, block, speed, authority)
    H->>H: ctc_to_track_controller: key by (line, block), drop the train ID
    Note right of H: Two suggestions for one block: the more restrictive speed and authority win.
    H->>M: step(dt, ctc.suggestions)
    M->>M: whole m/s and whole blocks, 0 or more, or reject the tick
    loop each block of each wayside
        alt a suggestion for the block
            M->>W: set_suggestion(block, speed, authority)
        else none
            M->>W: clear_suggestion(block): no track circuit
        end
    end
    Note right of W: The numbers never enter the PLC. The program only decides AUTH_n, pass or stop (UC-16).
